{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's been two years since the invasion of alien bugs. Most of humanity was wiped out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A small group of remaining resistance received a distress call from the abandoned city Kvitopol. Some person, who call herself Princess, requested an evacuation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Taras, one of the remaining resistance fighters. Taras has one simple job - to rescue this mysterious Princess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot alien bugs to make your way to Princess during action-packed episodes of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect Alien Cores to upgrade your weapons and power up your attacks.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect Gears and use your Skills to destroy even more aliens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destroy alien outposts, different obstacles and power down alien energy barriers to move forward.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3138020?t=1744057731","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138020/bbddd7354c309d67586fc2177f01f28f42d83dc0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744057731","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138020/2aaff3c6ac4566b743697554b8bb7ca2d0f18c6b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744057731","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138020/2aaff3c6ac4566b743697554b8bb7ca2d0f18c6b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744057731","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3297890,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's been two years since the invasion of alien bugs. Most of humanity was wiped out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A small group of remaining resistance received a distress call from the abandoned city Kvitopol. Some person, who call herself Princess, requested an evacuation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You play as Taras, one of the remaining resistance fighters. Taras has one simple job - to rescue this mysterious Princess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot alien bugs to make your way to Princess during action-packed episodes of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect Alien Cores to upgrade your weapons and power up your attacks.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect Gears and use your Skills to destroy even more aliens.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destroy alien outposts, different obstacles and power down alien energy barriers to move forward.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Fetysenko Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138020/4759ee9b14cbfe9e3b49cbb11e2d856c0fd6c877/header.jpg?t=1744057731","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257112289,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257112289/movie480.mp4?t=